ows from the plane with the footer's count, read time and coverage\"),\n    \"C08-N05\": (X, [\"C39-N01\"], \"View opens the detail with exactly the admitted actions; redacted fields stay redacted (C44-N01's sweep)\"),\n    \"C08-N06\": (X, [\"C37-N01\", \"C39-N01\"], \"a refused source is stated as needing a role (Open role issue), never as an empty inventory\"),\n    \"C08-N07\": (X, [\"C37-N01\", \"C39-N01\"], \"a failed read is stated with its coverage and time; the earlier read stays\"),\n    \"C08-N08\": (R, [], \"a credential generation's late reply is the core's: crates/desktop-core/tests/management_reads (replacing the client retires the earlier generation); the legacy Settings/Administration race has no native counterpart\"),\n    \"C08-N09\": (X, [\"C43-N01\"], \"a failing client is reported by the wizard's checks with Fix and verify again; the scan key stands apart\"),\n    \"C08-N10\": (P, [\"C44-N01\"], \"after a quit and relaunch the tenant is still active with its client and key kept (Administration reads again); Remove management client is the Settings page's (the core's management_reads suite)\"),\n    \"C08-N11\": (X, [\"C39-N04\"], \"keyboard reach of the table's controls at 900×600 and 200%\"),\n    \"C08-N12\": (X, [\"C44-N01\"], \"no plaintext secret in any destination's tree; the synthetic plane sees only the admitted requests\"),\n    # ---- C09 reviewed changes (legacy workbench) → the review sheet ----\n    \"C09-N01\": (X, [\"C39-N02\"], \"Edit… opens the review sheet; Review change prepares the review in the core; nothing is written before the native confirmation\"),\n    \"C09-N02\": (X, [\"C39-N02\"], \"the native confirmation names the update; Apply is disabled until the exact name\"),\n    \"C09-N03\": (R, [], \"changed-since-review and edited-after-review refusals are the core's: crates/desktop-core/tests/runtime_changes\"),\n    \"C09-N04\": (R, [], \"the destructive delete sheet and its one DELETE: crates/desktop-core/tests/runtime_changes and the host's sheet tests; the v2 board exercises the update path natively (C39-N02)\"),\n    \"C09-N05\": (R, [], \"API key creation with the profile's auth code: crates/desktop-core/tests/runtime_changes (the code never leaves the core)\"),\n    \"C09-N06\": (R, [], \"the one-time key sheet and the concealed clipboard: the host's secret-sheet tests (apps/desktop/src-tauri/tests) and crates/desktop-core/tests/runtime_changes\"),\n    \"C09-N07\": (R, [], \"key rotation and Clear key: crates/desktop-core/tests/runtime_changes\"),\n    \"C09-N08\": (R, [], \"a confirmed create with the plane stopped reports an unknown outcome: crates/desktop-core/tests/runtime_changes (transport failure)\"),\n    \"C09-N09\": (R, [], \"no replay after a relaunch mid-flight: crates/desktop-core/tests/runtime_changes\"),\n    \"C09-N10\": (X, [\"C39-N02\", \"C39-N04\"], \"the review sheet's controls reached by keyboard; the board's keyboard matrix at 200%\"),\n    \"C09-N11\": (R, [], \"a tenant switch retires open reviews and sheets: crates/desktop-core/tests/runtime_changes and the host's sheet tests\"),\n    \"C09-N12\": (R, [], \"sheet ownership across a second reveal: the host's secret-sheet tests\"),\n    # ---- C12 Case Library → Test Cases ----\n    \"C12-N01\": (X, [\"C40-N01\"], \"New case saves a Runtime case and a specification; 'sealed on this Mac, per tenant' in the title row\"),\n    \"C12-N02\": (X, [\"C40-N01\"], \"Open in Playground fills the Playground without scanning; a specification offers Inspect only\"),\n    \"C12-N03\": (X, [\"C40-N01\"], \"Load starter packs… lists the bundled packs and the public examples and loads the selected; Import… of the exported file says its cases are already here (a malformed catalog: crates/desktop-core/tests/library_observation)\"),\n    \"C12-N04\": (X, [\"C40-N01\"], \"Export… saves through the native sheet; Import… of that file; another tenant's file: crates/desktop-core/tests/library_observation\"),\n    \"C12-N05\"